IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `agafa-representation`

-- Attorney-General (Additional Functions) Act 2014, ss 2-5 and the Schedule -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_attorney-general-additional-functions-act-2014.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

§ `Fixtures`

